WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.790
Only five minutes left!

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:16.090
The final match of Holy Road's national tournament!

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:22.410
Who will stand at the top of JHS soccer, the famous Raimon Jr. High or the ever-capable Kidokawa Seishuu?!

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.250
The ball is still in Raimon's possession.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.840
A keystone of the team despite being only a first-year, midfielder Shindou isn't losing the ball to anyone!

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.130
There's Captain!

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:41.430
Look, Shindou's hands have begun to move with grace!

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:46.040
The ball is being passed within the Raimon Eleven according to Shindou's orders!

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.250
Like a conductor on the field playing the music of the game!

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.260
There goes the superior command of God's Baton!

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.440
God's Baton?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:43.890
There it is!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.720
Shindou's hissatsu shoot, Fortissimo!

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.920
It goes in!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.700
Raimon finally gets a point, making it 2-1!

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.160
Time is running short!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.780
The efforts of both teams are making this a close contest!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.160
This is so cool! Captain's going all-out!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.200
But they're acting according to Fifth Sector's orders in this game too, aren't they?

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:13.400
I watched last year's final really closely.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.210
Both teams looked like they were playing seriously, but...

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.200
Of course they were. It <i>was</i>  serious.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:26.680
Because it was a serious game, Shindou used both God's Baton and Fortissimo.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.210
The game is over!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:37.490
Despite Raimon's bold attack, the champions of this year's Holy Road is Kidokawa Seishuu with a score of 2-1!

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:38.850
A new reigning-

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:44.240
We lost, but I think everyone felt accomplished in that match.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:50.650
Although Fifth Sector manages the games, there are times when you're allowed to play to the fullest of your abilities.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:55.250
Although, a case like this one is rare on a grand stage like Holy Road.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:00.200
Even practice matches with other schools, like the one with Eito earlier,

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:04.180
can either have the score predetermined or be the kind where you can play without holding back.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.860
That's weird.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:07.930
Fifth Sector is definitely weird.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.390
By the way, why were you watching last year's game?

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.740
Holy Road is coming up.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:17.440
We watched it to see how it was like last year.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.900
Besides, this place has lots of records of previous games!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.320
Hey, good morning!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.740
You're early.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.680
Good morning!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.490
Is it just you guys?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.990
Yes...

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.950
Which is a shame since everyone came to the riverbank yesterday.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:34.170
Not everyone...

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.740
Captain and some others didn't come.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.040
Don't worry, they'll all be here soon.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.920
Holy Road...

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:56.230
When I was your age, the tournament was called Football Frontier.

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.270
Good morning.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.150
Morning!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.110
Senpai!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.150
Good morning!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.610
This is great, right, Tenma?

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.180
Yeah!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.600
Good morning!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.740
Good morning.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:11.540
You first-years are early.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.770
Hey, morning!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:14.880
You're here.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:16.880
Where's Captain?

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.610
Everyone!

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.760
The Holy Road district preliminaries are coming!

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.930
Let's start morning practice!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.420
Oh, you skipped morning practice too?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.490
I don't like that coach, you know.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.430
You had the right idea not coming yesterday.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.520
The riverbank?

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.580
Yeah.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:52.730
I somehow ended up just trailing after everyone, but now I'm regretting it.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:06:00.040
That coach told us stuff about "the faces of guys who want to play real soccer."

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.160
The man's a joke.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.480
Like, take that hot-bloodedness and shove it.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.010
You get hit because you keep looking at the ball!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.910
Shin-sama's here.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.270
Akane, you're quick!

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.530
Captain!

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:36.040
Tenma!

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.250
Good morning!

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.410
I wonder if Shindou-kun is going to quit...

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:04.250
Fifth Sector has given us an order.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:09.950
In the first match of this year's Holy Road district preliminaries, Raimon will lose 2-0.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.910
We don't score?

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.910
Fifth Sector's decisions are absolute.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.690
I see.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:17.750
If you'll excuse me.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.800
It was about Holy Road, right?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.920
Seems that we lose.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.740
But I'm not telling that to the others.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.590
Must we really leave well enough alone?

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:39.400
I don't believe leaving Endou Mamoru to his own devices is wise for this school.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:44.090
Principal Fuyukai, you seem to hold quite the grudge against Coach Endou.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.910
I don't understand the Holy Emperor's orders either!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:51.950
If we lose the first match, our school's reputation will drop like a stone!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.950
We have no choice but to obey the Holy Emperor for now.

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:59.470
Our school won second place in the national tournament last year.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:02.930
He must have decided that we've won too many victories.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:06.500
Sangoku-senpai asked for Shindou earlier.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.050
Do you know where they went?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.710
What am I, a mind reader?

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.280
Go look yourself. Maybe they're at the soccer club room.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.670
I found Captain! On the roof!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.300
Really? Thanks!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.270
Let's go!

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.130
I can't do it.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.270
I'm going to quit.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.890
Hey...

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:29.730
You do know how we felt trusting you as our captain, right?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.300
Is this because of what we saw at the riverbank yesterday?

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.630
You were there?

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:35.320
Yes.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:37.030
Captain!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.940
Are you really going to quit?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.410
Please don't!

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:47.120
We watched the video for last year's finals.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.580
Otonashi-sensei told us that it was a real game.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.840
God's Baton and Fortissimo were so cool!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.850
That's enough.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:09:00.430
If we work with Coach Endou, I just know that we'll get to play real soccer just like how you did in the finals!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.210
What is real soccer?

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.120
Like I said, in that final match-

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.380
Even that coach is going to get swallowed up by Fifth Sector one day.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:13.190
It's suffocating, listening to you.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:18.500
We're done here, right?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:19.660
Then I'll leave.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:25.540
Oh man...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.000
You want to resign?

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.150
Please take it.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.460
I won't accept it.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:47.260
Someone like you who loves soccer more than anyone shouldn't quit.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.280
You're joking!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.790
Shindou quit?!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.700
I heard he gave Coach his letter of resignation and went home.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.260
It's better that way.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:11.250
He made a shoot in the game with Eito.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.120
It means he took responsibility for his actions.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.240
You're cold!

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.760
It doesn't matter anyway. We graduate this year.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.790
Doing what we're told is the best way.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.310
Shin-sama is quitting?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.700
I knew it.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.610
I guess it's fitting, coming from Shindou-kun.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.130
You're so depressing!

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.820
Don't scare me like that!

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.280
And you call yourselves the Raimon Eleven?!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.990
A black mark wouldn't look good on his student record.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:42.860
Exactly.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.830
Holy Road is coming, too.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:50.040
Hey, maybe if we behave real good, we can have a normal game like last year's final!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.750
That was so great...

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:54.110
You guys are serious downers!

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:57.620
Is there no "OMG I love soccer!" like the first-years in you?

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:58.590
Nope.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.360
Hayami!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.040
Midori-chan, no violence.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.970
But these guys really piss me off!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.470
Captain wrote this?

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:11.150
Yeah.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.180
I want to go talk to Captain.

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:18.360
I don't think Captain wrote this with his true feelings in mind.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.200
You think so?

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:21.890
Yes!

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.550
I'll go to Captain's house after practice!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.680
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:34.310
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.430
This isn't a house, it's a castle!

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:06.450
Why did I let this guy into the room?

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.150
I have nothing to talk about.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.880
Captain, you're really amazing!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:22.740
With what?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.010
Being able to play the piano!

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.990
Is that where God's Baton came from? I'm so impressed!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.350
I want to see more of God's Baton!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.480
I knew last year's final was really-

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.850
No!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:40.320
That was because Fifth Sector allowed us a free game.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.820
In the end, we were just doing what they wanted us to do.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.530
Captain...

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:47.260
I'm not Captain anymore.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.150
I want to play soccer with you, Captain!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:52.330
I want to play under the command of God's Baton!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:53.750
Stop!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.840
If I stay in the soccer club, I'll grow to hate soccer, I just know it!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:07.280
I think you've been protecting your love for soccer.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.910
What are you saying?

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:12.070
That's why you said you'd quit.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:15.230
But if you quit, it'll make the soccer you love sad.

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:17.940
Stop talking about soccer like it's a friend!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.510
We disobeyed Fifth Sector's decision in our match with Eito!

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:27.670
Do you have any idea how much trouble that'll cause our entire school?

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:30.040
I haven't done anything wrong!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.990
It's no use screaming over it.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:35.920
Soccer has no worth now.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.210
That's not true!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:42.510
I think that goal we made in the Eito match is really important!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.510
Really important...

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:48.650
What value does soccer have now?

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:51.140
The soccer world is being controlled...

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:55.200
By people who don't even have a drop of love for soccer in them!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:14:00.110
But I think Coach Endou will help us to play real soccer!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.730
Everyone came to the riverbank yesterday!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:06.070
Then that only confirms my point that I don't have to be captain.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.430
It makes no difference who does it.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.990
Besides...

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:15.940
Coach Endou will end up obeying Fifth Sector too, one day.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:18.960
Leave.

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:25.070
Okay.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.110
I'll go.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.130
I'm sorry for speaking out of line.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.980
I have one last request.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.720
Show me Fortissimo!

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:35.960
I know!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:39.290
How about I call Shinsuke and the three of us play soccer together?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.060
He saw the video too and he was really excited about it!

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.730
I told you to leave!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.830
I won't.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.440
Are you still trying to pressure me?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:52.030
When you passed the ball to me in the Eito match...

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.160
I felt like it was telling me...

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.540
To face soccer straight-on.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:05.980
I didn't mean...

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:08.420
I won't take on your passes anymore.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.390
But I want to play with you, Captain!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.120
Lay off!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.180
It has to be you, Captain!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:16.890
I want to play with you!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.050
Please!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.500
Fine.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.570
Just one time.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.600
Thank you!

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:31.410
I can invite Shinsuke to join, right?

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.500
Yeah, go ahead.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.200
You really love soccer, don't you?

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:39.770
Yes!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:46.020
Captain, here I go!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.420
I'll pick up all of Tenma's passes!

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.380
Here!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.540
Watch the ball closely!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.350
Liking soccer and being good at it are two different things!

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:01.430
Fortissimo!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:08.850
Whoa...

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:09.890
It's the real thing!

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:11.230
Now are you satisfied?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.200
Thank you!

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:20.700
I'll do my best.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.840
Me too!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:25.220
If we get to play real soccer some day...

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:26.790
Will you come back?

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.700
You don't get it, do you?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:30.920
Real soccer is dead!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.290
Tenma!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:48.900
Okay!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.170
Real soccer being dead isn't true!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:58.200
I bet even soccer is waiting for us to start playing real soccer!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:01.700
If you really feel that way, try and get past me!

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:11.420
Tenma, you can do it!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:12.920
Not good enough.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.430
Wow! He's got a firm hold of the ball!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.020
I'll do it!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.050
I'll <i>become</i>  real soccer!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.770
You're going to become it?

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.030
That's how much resolve I'll have to do it!

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.390
If only I had it as easy as you...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.200
I'll definitely get past you!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.830
He's faster than he was during practice!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.750
Soyokaze Step!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.750
Zephyr Step

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.370
Wind?

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.660
I got past Captain...

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:02.150
All right! That endless practice finally paid off!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:05.140
I did it! Soyokaze Step!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:07.950
Soyokaze Step...

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.060
It's a good offense.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.170
It was so amazing! Like you were the wind itself!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.070
The wind, huh?

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.530
Captain!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.330
I'm going to use this to fight this year's Holy Road!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:22.190
I'll charge right through the other team with this dribble!

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.030
Things are burning up!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.330
Now we have to get you a hissatsu technique, Shinsuke!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.010
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:37.380
Compared to your hard work, I...

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.300
I'm not qualified to be captain after all.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.340
No way...

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:43.670
You are.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.570
Coach!

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:46.510
Coach...

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:50.560
Those tears make you qualified to be captain.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:59.820
Your feelings of loving soccer so, so much are reflected through those tears.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:04.830
You truly are God's Baton.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:12.080
Like a top-class conductor drawing out a performer's potential, you made Tenma's abilities show results.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.000
Coach, the truth...

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.970
The truth is, I want to win too!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.890
I don't want to play this appalling façade of soccer anymore!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.590
I've been waiting to hear those words from you, Captain.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:33.740
I'll do my best!

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.510
Let's win for sure!

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.500
Yeah!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.970
There's no such thing as a game that's okay to lose!

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:39.910
Yes, sir!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:45.240
Maybe it was because I wanted to see this smile.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.340
That's why I let him in.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.370
Captain isn't quitting.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.910
Isn't that great, Sasuke?

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:07.290
I can't wait for Holy Road.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.020
I hope that person will be watching too, somewhere...

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:33.950
Yeah, let's go to bed! It's an early day tomorrow!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.890
So you didn't quit.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:49.350
Heading to morning practice?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.390
How dedicated.

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:53.060
You come too. You're part of the club.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.040
You have an order from Fifth Sector.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:21:00.400
Raimon loses at 2-0 in Holy Road's first district preliminary match.

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:09.500
<i>There's no such thing as a game that's okay to lose!</i>

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:11.200
Captain!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.730
Good morning, Captain!

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:16.390
Yeah...

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.540
I can't wait to show my Soyokaze Step to the others!

00:22:54.050 --> 00:22:56.300
Victory and loss are predetermined in Holy Road.

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:59.010
But we're going to play <i>our</i>  soccer!

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:04.200
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO,
 The Curtains Rise At Last! Holy Road!!

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:05.900
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:25.600
Liking and being good at something are two different things!

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:26.440
That's all!
